The three-file abstract Sturm theorem closure is copied under
src/Transformer/Landscape/Sturm, with project namespaces, split modules, auxiliary
paper citations, and the current Mathlib sign import. Mathlib v4.36.0 proves
Sign.lean's constant-sign lemma as IsPreconnected.sign_eq_of_continuousOn, so
that copy is removed and the project uses Mathlib's. No executable,
integer-arithmetic certificate infrastructure, or package dependency is added.
The signed Euclidean-chain construction and its applications are project work.
